\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Architecture of the inclusive mobile messaging system. The presentation layer~(React~Native), business layer (Spring~Boot REST~API and Django AI~API with RabbitMQ), persistence layer~(PostgreSQL), and multimodal conversion modules (TTS, STT, image-to-text, image-to-audio, video captioning) with end-to-end AES encryption are shown.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
